libmcpu: libmcpu (MCPU virtual CPU and development tools)
libmcpu:
libmcpu: LibMCPU implements the MCPU virtual processor and provides its
libmcpu: assembler, linker, runtime, MELF object support, and binary
libmcpu: utilities. The package also provides the target-side ABI files used
libmcpu: for MCPU system software, runtime libraries, compilers, and programs.
libmcpu: LibMCPU uses LibMPU for integer, real, and complex arithmetic and
libmcpu: LibMPUIO for host-side input/output support.
